                  <p><mark class="hl-class" data-pair="5">The radiographic appearance of cysts is characteristic and exhibits a distinct, dense periphery of reactive bone with a radiolucent center. Most cysts are unilocular; however, multilocular forms are often seen in some keratocysts and cystic ameloblastomas.</mark></p>`,
